@startuml
title Auralis - Device Session State

[*] --> Discovered

Discovered --> Pairing : pair()
Pairing --> Paired : success
Pairing --> Failed : error/timeout

Paired --> Connecting : connect()
Connecting --> Connected : bluetooth connected
Connecting --> Failed : error

Connected --> AudioEndpointPending : wait for audio route
AudioEndpointPending --> AudioReady : endpoint available
AudioEndpointPending --> Failed : timeout/failure

AudioReady --> Streaming : session start / join
Streaming --> Reconnecting : unexpected disconnect
Streaming --> Disconnecting : user disconnect

Reconnecting --> AudioEndpointPending : bluetooth restored
Reconnecting --> Failed : retry policy exhausted

AudioEndpointPending --> Resyncing : endpoint restored during active session
Resyncing --> Streaming : buffer + sync ready

Disconnecting --> Disconnected
Failed --> Discovered : retry / rescan
Disconnected --> Connecting : reconnect
Disconnected --> [*]
@enduml
